  Text to speech
  Choose what Codex reads aloud. Esc or Ctrl+C stops playback.

› 1. Off (current)       Keep messages silent.
  2. Final               Speak final answers and interactive questions.
  3. Progress and final  Also speak progress updates.

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
